helpcontent2	source\text\shared\fontwork_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AA				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Switches the letter height of the selected Fontwork objects from normal to the same height for all object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
