helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	bs	This menu contains general commands for working with Draw documents, such as open, close and print. To close $[officename] Draw, click \<emph\>Exit\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
