helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	bs	The following is a description of all $[officename] Draw menus, submenus and their dialogs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Drawing Bar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sdraw/main0210.xhp\" name=\"Drawing Bar\"\>Drawing Bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	bs	The \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar holds the main drawing tools.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D1				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10060000.xhp\"\>Rectangle\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E1				0	bs	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EE				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10070000.xhp\"\>Ellipse\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FE				0	bs	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN1060B				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10050000.xhp\"\>Text\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061B				0	bs	Draws a text box where you click or drag in the current document. Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B4				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Points\"\>Points\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C3				0	bs	Enables you to edit points on your drawing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
