helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959	2			0	bs	Use this menu to open and edit the symbol catalog, or import an external formula as a data file. The program interface can be adjusted to meet your requirements. You can also change the program options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
