helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145412				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SendAbstractToStarImpre\"\>Opens the current document as a $[officename] Impress presentation. The current document must contain at least one predefined heading paragraph style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149801				0	bs	Included Outline Levels				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153667				0	bs	Enter the number of outline levels to include in the new presentation. For example, if you choose one level, only the paragraphs that follow the "Heading 1" paragraph style are included.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154478				0	bs	Subpoints per Level				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145580	6			0	bs	Enter the number of paragraphs that you want to include below each outline level (heading). 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	AutoFormat				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153925				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>AutoFormat function; text documents\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153925				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150000.xhp\" name=\"AutoFormat\"\>AutoFormat\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151182	2			0	bs	Automatically formats the file according to the options that you set under \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - AutoCorrect\"\>\<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147570				0	bs	To open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150101.xhp\" name=\"AutoFormat for Tables\"\>AutoFormat for Tables\</link\> dialog, click in a table cell, and then choose \<emph\>Format - AutoFormat\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Protect				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146322				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05100300.xhp\" name=\"Protect\"\>Protect\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145822				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>Prevents the contents of the selected cells from being modified.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154641				0	bs	When the cursor is in a read-only cell, a note appears on the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292				0	bs	To remove cell protection, select the cell(s), and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05100400.xhp\" name=\"Format - Cell - Remove Protection\"\>\<emph\>Format - Cell - Remove Protection\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
