helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05190000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149880				0	bs	Custom heading (apply style)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05190000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148389				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_SPLIT_TABLE:RB_BOX_PARA\"\>Inserts a blank header row in the second table that is formatted with the style of the first row in the original table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
