helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156030				0	bs	Macros				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156043				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the macro that executes when the selected event occurs.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156058				0	bs	Frames allow you to link certain events to a function that then decides if the event is handled by $[officename] Writer or by the function. See the $[officename] Basic Help for more information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149271				0	bs	Category				2002-02-02 02:02:02
