helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151175	2			0	bs	\<variable id=\"htmltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NewHtmlDoc\"\>Saves the file as an HTML document, so that you can view it in a web browser. You can choose to create a separate page when a heading style that you specify is encountered in the document.\</ahelp\> If you choose this option, a separate page of links to all of the pages that are generated is also created.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
