helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154028	32			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Jumps to the next item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>\<emph\>Navigation\</emph\>\</link\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".\</ahelp\>Jumps to the next item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3150773\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20175.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150773\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
