helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154646				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ControlCodes\"\>Shows nonprinting characters in your text, such as paragraph marks, line breaks, tab stops, and spaces.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145410				0	bs	When you delete a paragraph mark, the paragraph that is merged takes on the formatting of the paragraph that the cursor is in.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Hidden Paragraphs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155959				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03140000.xhp\" name=\"Hidden Paragraphs\"\>Hidden Paragraphs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150251				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowHiddenParagraphs\"\>Shows or hides hidden paragraphs.\</ahelp\> This option only affects the screen display of hidden paragraphs, and not the printing of hidden paragraphs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	bs	Use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"field command\"\>field command\</link\> "Hidden Paragraph" to assign a \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\> that must be met to hide a paragraph. If the condition is not met, the paragraph is displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451				0	bs	When you hide a paragraph, footnotes and frames that are anchored to characters in the paragraph are also hidden.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154643				0	bs	\<variable id=\"tabelletext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TableDialog\"\>Specifies the properties of the selected table, for example, name, alignment, spacing, column width, borders, and background.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
