helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150658				0	bs	Database selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150671				0	bs	Select a registered database that you want to insert the selected field from. You can also change the table or query that the selected field refers to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
