helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149805	2			0	bs	\<variable id=\"feldbefehltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertField\"\>Inserts a field at the current cursor position. Fields contain information that can be automatically updated, such as the date, time, or page number.\</ahelp\> The dialog lists all available fields.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155903				0	bs	Insert				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154190	179			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FIELD_INSERT\"\>Inserts the selected field at the current cursor position in the document. You can insert fields into your document so long as this dialog is open. To close the dialog, click the \<emph\>Close \</emph\>button.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Fields				2002-02-02 02:02:02
