helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3150554				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:CB_RELTOSTYLE\"\>Positions the tab stop relative to the "indent from left" value defined in the paragraph style selected on the \<emph\>Styles\</emph\> tab. Otherwise the tab stop is positioned relative to the left text margin.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
