helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154480				0	bs	1st key				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152953				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PRIM_KEY\"\>Makes the current selection a subentry of the word that you enter here. For example, if you select "cold", and enter "weather" as the 1st key, the index entry is "weather, cold".\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154572				0	bs	2nd key				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_SEC_KEY\"\>Makes the current selection a sub-subentry of the 1st key. For example, if you select "cold", and enter "weather" as the 1st key and "winter" as the 2nd key, the index entry is "weather, winter, cold".\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155174				0	bs	Phonetic reading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149484				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PHONETIC_READING\"\>Enter the phonetic reading for the corresponding entry. For example, if a Japanese Kanji word has more than one pronunciation, enter the correct pronunciation as a Katakana word. The Kanji word is then sorted according to the phonetic reading entry.\</ahelp\> This option is only available if Asian language support is enabled.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
