helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156278	12			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_GRF_EXT:ED_CONNECT\"\>Displays the path to the linked graphic file. To change the link, click the browse button (\<emph\>...\</emph\>) and then locate the file that you want to link to. \</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151373				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_GRF_EXT:PB_BROWSE\"\>Locate the new graphic file that you want to link to, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
