helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150688				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_LISTITEM\"\>Enter a new item.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
