helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147473				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_PB_LISTADD\"\>Adds the \<emph\>Item\</emph\> to the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147496				0	bs	Items on list				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FLD_FUNC_LB_LISTITEMS\"\>Lists the items. The topmost item is shown in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
