helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	bs	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040501.xhp\" name=\"Options\"\>\<emph\>Options\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, where you can edit the column layout, background, footnote and endnote behavior of the selected section.\</ahelp\> If the section is password protected, you must enter the password first.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
