helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148775				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertNeutralParagraph\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts a paragraph without numbering. The existing numbering will not be affected.\</ahelp\> The icon is only visible if the cursor is positioned in a numbered or bulleted text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
