helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"FN_INSERT_FOOTER\"\>Displays the footer of an HTML document if footers are enabled on the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05040400.xhp\" name=\"Format - Page - Footer\"\>\<emph\>Format - Page - Footer\</emph\>\</link\> tab page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
