helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150760				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageNumberField\"\>Inserts the current page number as a field at the cursor position.\</ahelp\> The default setting is the Page Style format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
