helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3148858				0	bs	The contents of the text document are embedded into the current document and are not updated if the source file is changed. If you want the contents to automatically update when you change the source document, insert the file as a link.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
