helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968				0	bs	If the target text document contains sections, you can select the section that you want to insert in the\<emph\> Sections\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
