helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	bs	You can change a field to regular text, so that it is no longer updated. After you change a field to text, you cannot change the text back into a field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155608				0	bs	Select the field and choose \<emph\>Edit - Cut\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154238				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	bs	Click "Unformatted text" in the\<emph\> Selection\</emph\> list, and then click\<emph\> OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3157551				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\" name=\"Paste Special\"\>Paste Special\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
