helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149686				0	bs	Adjusting Page Margins				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3155175				0	bs	The margins of a page are indicated by the filled areas at the ends of the rulers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149038				0	bs	Changing Indents				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631				0	bs	Indents are adjusted with the three small triangles on the horizontal ruler.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3152776	26			0	bs	To change the left or the right paragraph indent, select the paragraph(s) that you want change the indent for, drag the bottom left or the bottom right triangle on the horizontal ruler to a new location. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3145769				0	bs	To change the first line indent of a selected paragraph, drag the top left triangle on the horizontal ruler to a new location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	bs	You can also double-click anywhere on the horizontal ruler, and adjust the indents in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Inserting Graphics				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154922				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>text; inserting pictures in\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>images; inserting in text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>illustrations; inserting in text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting; pictures\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pictures; inserting\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154922				0	bs	\<variable id=\"insert_graphic\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Graphics\"\>Inserting Graphics\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3149695				0	bs	There are several ways to insert a graphic object in a text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Calculating Cell Totals in Tables				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147400				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;sums in text tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>totals in text tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text tables;calculating sums\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables;calculating sums\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells;calculating sums\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>table cells;calculating sums\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sums of table cell series\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147400				0	bs	\<variable id=\"calculate_intable\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_intable.xhp\" name=\"Calculating Cell Totals in Tables\"\>Calculating the sum of a series of table cells\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154243				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Table\</emph\>, and insert a table with one column and more than one row into a text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154203				0	bs	Type a number in each cell of the column, but leave the last cell in the column empty.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154222				0	bs	Place the cursor in the last cell of the column, and then click the \<emph\>Sum\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Table Bar\</emph\>.\<br/\>The\<emph\> Formula Bar\</emph\> appears with the entry "=sum".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147775				0	bs	Click in the first cell of the series you want to sum up, drag to the final cell, and then release.\<br/\>$[officename] inserts a formula for calculating the sum of the values in the current column.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150507	8			0	bs	Press Enter, or click \<emph\>Apply\</emph\> in the Formula bar. \<br/\>The sum of the values in the current column is entered in the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150533				0	bs	If you enter a different number anywhere in the column, the sum is updated as soon as you click in the last column cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533				0	bs	Similarly, you can also quickly calculate the sum of a row of numbers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146875				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>headers; changing from selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>footers; changing from selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page styles; changing from selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>creating; page styles from selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>new page styles from selection\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146875				0	bs	\<variable id=\"change_header\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/change_header.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page\"\>Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153584				0	bs	You can design a page layout and then create a page style based on it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3154245				0	bs	For example, you can create a page style that displays a particular header, and another page style that displays a different header.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	bs	Open a new text document, choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Page Styles\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150532				0	bs	Click the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon and select \<emph\>New Styles from Selection\</emph\> from the submenu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153153				0	bs	Type a name for the page in the \<emph\>Style name \</emph\>box, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153184	32			0	bs	Double-click the name in the list to apply the style to the current page. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155541				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Header\</emph\>, and choose the new page style from the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155572				0	bs	Type the text that you want in the header. Position the cursor into the main text area outside of the header.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155592				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Manual Break\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147771				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>area, select \<emph\>Page break\</emph\> and then select 'Default' from the \<emph\>Style \</emph\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147810				0	bs	Repeat steps 2-6 to create a second custom \<emph\>Page Style\</emph\> with a different header.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_date_conv.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Turning Number Recognition On or Off in Tables				2002-02-02 02:02:02
