helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	12			0	bs	Index entries are inserted as fields into your document. To view fields in your document, choose \<emph\>View \</emph\>and ensure that \<emph\>Field Shadings \</emph\>is selected. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155507				0	bs	Place the cursor immediately in front of the index entry in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155526	16			0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Index Entry\</emph\>, and do one of the following: 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155893				0	bs	To cycle through the index entries in your document, click the next or the previous arrows in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02160000.xhp\" name=\"Edit Index Entry dialog\"\>\<emph\>Edit Index Entry\</emph\> dialog\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
