helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155911				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>styles; creating from selections\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>templates; creating from selections\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>creating;new styles from selections\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
