helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150101				0	bs	\<variable id=\"numbering_lines\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/numbering_lines.xhp\" name=\"Adding Line Numbers\"\>Adding Line Numbers\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149842				0	bs	$[officename] can automatically count and add line numbers to the lines in an entire document or to selected paragraphs in your document. Line numbers are included when you print your document, but not when you save the document as HTML. You can specify the line numbering interval, the starting line number, and whether to count blank lines or lines in frames. You can also add a separator between line numbers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153410				0	bs	To add line numbers to an entire document:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Line Numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149612				0	bs	Select \<emph\>Show numbering\</emph\>, and then select the options that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3145101				0	bs	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156241				0	bs	To add line numbers to specific paragraphs:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3156264				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Line Numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153385				0	bs	Select \<emph\>Show numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	bs	Right-click the "Default" paragraph style and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150222				0	bs	All paragraph styles are based on the "Default" style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	bs	Click the \<emph\>Numbering\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150956				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Line Numbering \</emph\>area, clear the \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering \</emph\>check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150520				0	bs	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151077				0	bs	Select the paragraph(s) where you want to add the line numbers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151096				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Numbering \</emph\>tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153733				0	bs	Select \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153758				0	bs	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3146864				0	bs	You can also create a paragraph style that includes line numbering, and apply it to the paragraphs that you want to add line numbers to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
