helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150721				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Numbering \</emph\>tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3148389				0	bs	Select the \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering \</emph\>check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
