helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076F				0	bs	$[officename] collects words that you frequently use in the current session. When you later type the first three letters of a collected word, $[officename] automatically completes the word. If you want, you can also save the current list of collected words so that it can be used in the next session. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078D				0	bs	 Using word completion 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN10794				0	bs	By default, you accept the word completion by pressing the Enter key. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079B				0	bs	 To reject the word completion, continue typing with any other key. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
