helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fillformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	bs	You can quickly apply styles, such as paragraph and character styles, in your document by using the Fill Format Mode in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fillformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fillformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3153128				0	bs	Click the icon of the style category that you want to apply.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fillformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090	17			0	bs	Click the style, and then click the \<emph\>Fill Format Mode\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3149644\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_fillstyle.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149644\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> in the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
