helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10812				0	bs	$[officename] uses page styles to specify the background of the pages in a document. For example, to change the page background of one or more pages in a document to a watermark, you need to create a page style that uses the watermark background, and then apply the page style to the pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10820				0	bs	To Change the Page Background				2002-02-02 02:02:02
