helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10837				0	bs	In the list of page styles, right-click an item, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083F				0	bs	On the \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> tab page, type a name for the page style in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1084B				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box, select the page style that you want to apply to the next page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
