helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3153166				0	bs	Click "Conditional text" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256				0	bs	Type "Page > 1" in the \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145280				0	bs	Type "Pages" in the \<emph\>Then\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145305				0	bs	Type "Page" in the \<emph\>Otherwise\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	bs	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Inserting a Scanned Image				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156017				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>inserting;scanned images\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pictures; scanning\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>scanning pictures\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156017				0	bs	\<variable id=\"insert_graphic_scan\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic_scan.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Scanned Image\"\>Inserting a Scanned Image\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	bs	To insert a scanned image, the scanner must be connected to your system and the scanner software drivers must be installed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182	3			0	bs	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>The scanner must support the TWAIN standard. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>The Scanner must support the SANE standard. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155915				0	bs	Click in the document where you want to insert the scanned image.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	bs	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Picture - Scan\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Picture - Scan\</emph\>\</link\>, and choose the scanning source from the submenu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	bs	Follow the scanning instructions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Modifying Cross-References				2002-02-02 02:02:02
