helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149291				0	bs	\<variable id=\"references_modify\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/references_modify.xhp\" name=\"Modifying Cross-References\"\>Modifying Cross-References\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3153132				0	bs	Click in front of the cross-reference that you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	bs	If you cannot see the field shading of the cross-reference, choose \<emph\>View - Field Shadings\</emph\> or press \<emph\>Ctrl+F8\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3149611				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3145101				0	bs	Set the options that you want, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	bs	Use the arrow buttons in the \<emph\>Edit Fields \</emph\>dialog to browse through the cross-references in the current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
