helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3145569				0	bs	The default template contains the default formatting information for new text documents. If you want, you can create a new template and use it as  the default template.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149838				0	bs	Create a document and the content and formatting styles that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3156101				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>File - Templates - Save\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	bs	In the \<emph\>New Template\</emph\> box, type a name for the new template.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Categories \</emph\>list, select "Default", and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
