helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10614				0	bs	You can print a Writer document as a brochure or a booklet. That is, Writer prints two pages on each side of the paper, so that when you fold the paper, you can read the document as a book.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	bs	When you create a document that you want to print as a brochure, use portrait orientation for the pages. Writer applies the brochure layout when you print the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
