helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070E				0	bs	In the properties dialog for your printer, set the paper orientation to landscape.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10628				0	bs	Return to \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, and click \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1062C				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Pages\</emph\> area of the \<emph\>Printer Options\</emph\> dialog, select \<emph\>Brochure\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10740				0	bs	For a printer that automatically prints on both sides of a page, specify to print right pages and left pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10630				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EA				0	bs	If %PRODUCTNAME prints the pages in the wrong order, open the \<emph\>Printer Options\</emph\> dialog, select \<emph\>Reversed\</emph\>, and then print the document again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Animating Text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
