helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145596				0	bs	Click the \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145620				0	bs	In the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> list, select the word pair that you want to remove.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145645				0	bs	Click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145668				0	bs	To stop replacing quotation marks:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151196				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151220				0	bs	Click the \<emph\>Custom Quotes\</emph\> tab				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	bs	Clear the \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> check box(es).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155076				0	bs	To stop capitalizing the first letter of a sentence:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155099	10			0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155123				0	bs	Click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155148				0	bs	Clear the \<emph\>Capitalize first letter of every sentence\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155401				0	bs	To stop drawing a line when you type three identical characters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155415				0	bs	$[officename] automatically draws a line when you type three of the following characters and press Enter: - _ = * ~ #				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155439				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155463				0	bs	Click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155488				0	bs	Clear the \<emph\>Apply border\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
