helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154247				0	bs	To open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, press F5.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155878				0	bs	To quickly jump to a location in your document, double-click an item listed in the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
