helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	bs	In the \<emph\>New Template \</emph\>box, type a name for the new template.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	bs	Select a template category in the \<emph\>Categories \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
