helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	bs	To create a document based on the template, choose\<emph\> File - New - Templates and Documents\</emph\>, select the template, and then click\<emph\> Open\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
