helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417				0	bs	Hold down Ctrl and drag a selection in the first numbered paragraph. You only have to select one character.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	bs	Continue to hold down Ctrl, and drag a selection in each numbered paragraph of the lists you want to combine.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
