helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	bs	Click \<emph\>Input field \</emph\>in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3154257				0	bs	Click \<emph\>Insert \</emph\>and type the text for the variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
