helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918				0	bs	You can delete a table from your document, or delete the contents of the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155863				0	bs	To delete a whole table, click in the table, and then choose \<emph\>Table - Delete - Table\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	bs	To delete the contents of a table, click in the table, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A until all cells are selected, and then press Delete or Backspace.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
