helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:LISTBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_HTMLOPT:LB_EXPORT\"\>Defines the settings for exporting HTML documents.\</ahelp\> To export in HTML format select the \<emph\>HTML Document\</emph\> file type in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"Save As\"\>\<emph\>Save As\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. You can find further instructions in the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"Import and export filters\"\>Import and export filters\</link\> description.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	bs	To optimize the HTML export, select a browser or HTML standard from the Export box. If "$[officename] Writer" is selected, specific $[officename] Writer instructions are exported.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
