helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150872				0	bs	You must activate this option before you create the $[officename] Basic Script, since otherwise it will not be inserted. $[officename] Basic Scripts must be located in the header of the HTML document. Once you have created the macro in the $[officename] Basic IDE, it appears in the source text of the HTML document in the header.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
