helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144761				0	bs	Not at start of line:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156214				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_START\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the beginning of a line.\</ahelp\>  If a character typed here is positioned at the beginning of a line after a line break, it is automatically  moved to the end of the previous line.  For example, an exclamation point at the end of a sentence never appears at the start of a line if it is part of the \<emph\>Not at start of line\</emph\> list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154908				0	bs	Not at end of line:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	26			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_END\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the end of a line.\</ahelp\>  If a character typed here is positioned at the end of a line due to a line break, it is automatically moved to the beginning of the next line. For example, a currency symbol that appears in front of an amount  never appears at the end of a line if it is part of the\<emph\> Not at end of line\</emph\> list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
