helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149484				0	bs	This option allows you to select the default for \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#speichern\" name=\"relative\"\>relative\</link\> addressing of URLs in the file system and on the Internet. Relative addressing is only possible if the source document and the referenced document are both on the same drive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
