helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10856				0	bs	When you open a file by an URL from the Windows file dialog, Windows will open a local copy of the file, located in the Internet Explorer cache. The %PRODUCTNAME file dialog opens the remote file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
