helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149516				0	bs	\<variable id=\"anlinie\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_GRID_CBX_SNAP_HELPLINES\"\>Snaps the edge of a dragged object to the nearest snap line when you release the mouse.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142				0	bs	You can also define this setting by using the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13140000.xhp\" name=\"Snap to Snap Lines\"\>\<emph\>Snap to Snap Lines\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13140000.xhp\" name=\"Snap to Snap Lines\"\>\<emph\>Snap to Snap Lines\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Snap to Snap Lines\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> icon, which is available in the \<emph\>Option\</emph\> bar in a presentation or drawing document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154306				0	bs	To the page margins				2002-02-02 02:02:02
