helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143267				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01130100.xhp\" name=\"VBA Properties\"\>VBA Properties\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
