helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160200.xhp	0	help	par_idN10561				0	bs	Add, modify, or remove entries to the list of registered databases. You must register a database within %PRODUCTNAME in order to see it in the \<emph\>View - Data sources\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
