helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	bs	To zoom in or zoom out on a single object in the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, double-click the object, or select the object, and then press the Spacebar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
