helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3160463				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AlignLeft\"\>Aligns the left edges of the selected objects. If only one object is selected in Draw or Impress, the left edge of the object is aligned to the left page margin.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150146				0	bs	Objects are aligned to the left edge of the leftmost object in the selection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150445	3			0	bs	\<variable id=\"mehrfachselektion\"\>To align the individual objects in a group, \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>choose \<emph\>Format - Group - Edit Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>double-click\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to enter the group, select the objects, right-click, and then choose an alignment option.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
