helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147223				0	bs	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_INSCONT:BTN_TRANSPOSE\"\>Cells from the left column become the top row and the top row becomes the left column.\</ahelp\> Objects contained in the clipboard are scaled to fit the output range. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
