helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	bs	\<variable id=\"verknuepfungentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ManageLinks\"\>Lets you edit the properties of each link in the current document, including the path to the source file. This command is not available if the current document does not contain links to other files.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	bs	When you open a file that contains links, you are prompted to update the links. Depending on where the linked files are stored, the update process can take several minutes to complete.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	bs	If you are loading a file that contains DDE links, you are prompted to update the links. Decline the update if you do not want to establish a connection to the DDE server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10646				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"34869\"\>Double-click a link in the list to open a file dialog where you can select another object for this link.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
