helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155599	2			0	bs	\<variable id=\"plugin\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPlugin\"\>Inserts a plug-in into the current document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> A \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#plugin\" name=\"plug-in\"\>plug-in\</link\> is a software component that extends the capabilities of a web browser.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
