helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04180100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ViewDataSourceBrowser\"\>Lists the databases that are registered in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> and lets you manage the contents of the databases.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04180100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156136				0	bs	The \<emph\>Data sources\</emph\> command is only available when a text document or a spreadsheet is open.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04180100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	bs	You can insert fields from a database into your file or you can create forms to access the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
