helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_BORDER:LB_LINECOLOR\"\>Select the line color that you want to use for the selected border(s).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
