helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3158410				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_BORDER_MF_BOTTOM\"\>Enter the distance that you want to have between the bottom border and the contents of the selection.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
