helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153089				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bold\"\>Makes the selected text bold. If the cursor is in a word, the entire word is made bold. If the selection or word is already bold, the formatting is removed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
