helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	bs	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>If you choose \<emph\>Record - Show\</emph\>, the lines containing changed text passages are indicated by a vertical line in the left page margin. You can set the properties of the vertical line and the other markup elements by choosing \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040700.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Changes\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Changes\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
