helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_ORGANIZE_COPY_FROM\"\>Imports an additional template. To import a template, select a template folder in the list, click the \<emph\>Command\</emph\> button, and then select \<emph\>Import template\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
