helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147086				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_ORGANIZE_PRINTER_SETUP\"\>Changes the printer and its settings for the selected document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
