helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147000				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXFLOAT_3D:BTN_TEXTURE\"\>Sets the properties of the surface texture for the selected 3D object. This feature is only available after you apply a surface textures to the selected object. To quickly apply a surface texture, open the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, hold down Shift+Ctrl, and then drag an image onto the selected 3D object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
