helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE3_GIF\" visibility=\"visible\"\>The files are exported as GIF files\</ahelp\> GIF files are compressed without loss of data, and have a maximum of 256 colors.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
