helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can use this page to import user data from a previously installed version of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
