helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Copies the user name and other data from a previous %PRODUCTNAME installation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B2				0	bs	User name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The user name is used for the document properties, templates, and when you record changes made to documents. This page is only displayed if a previous installation of %PRODUCTNAME is not found on your computer.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
