helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183	18			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_AS_TABLE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts data selected from the data source browser into the document as a table.\</ahelp\>In the \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog, select the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> option to insert the selected data into the document as a table. In the dialog, you can decide which database fields or columns are transferred, and how the text table is formatted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
