helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159150				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterSolarize\"\>Opens a dialog for defining solarization.\</ahelp\> Solarization refers to an effect that looks like what can happen when there is too much light during photo development. The colors become partly inverted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
