helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163712				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterSepia\"\>Opens a dialog for setting the aging function.\</ahelp\> Each time you call this function, the image appears a little bit darker; the colors can be made more gray or brown.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153139				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3159196\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphicfiltersepia.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159196\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145365				0	bs	Aging				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156443				0	bs	Aging Degree				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVX_GRFFILTER_DLG_SEPIA_DLG_FILTERSEPIA_MTR_SEPIA\"\>Defines the intensity of aging, in percent. The higher the value, the more the image ages.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119				0	bs	Posterize				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterPoster\"\>Opens a dialog to determine the number of poster colors.\</ahelp\> This effect is based on the reduction of the number of colors. It makes photos look like paintings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155851				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3150658\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphicfilterposter.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150658\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284				0	bs	Posterize				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156736				0	bs	Poster Colors				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151280				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_NUMERICFIELD_RID_SVX_GRFFILTER_DLG_POSTER_DLG_FILTERPOSTER_NUM_POSTER\"\>Specifies the number of colors to which the image is to be reduced.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144767				0	bs	Pop Art				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153512				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterPopart\"\>Converts an image to a pop-art format.\</ahelp\> By applying color alienation, the image acquires a completely new character. This function can be applied to the whole image or to parts of it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148495				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3156437\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphicfilterpopart.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156437\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151207				0	bs	Pop Art				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153003				0	bs	Charcoal Sketch				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152971				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterSobel\"\>Displays the image as a charcoal sketch.\</ahelp\> The contours of the image are drawn in black, and the original colors are suppressed. You can apply this function to the whole image or to a part of it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150327				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3154636\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphicfiltersobel.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154636\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
