helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150808				0	bs	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbviewaliases.png\" id=\"img_id3151315\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151315\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
