helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Stop\"\>Click to interrupt the current loading process, Ctrl-click to interrupt all loading processes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
