helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\callouts.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056A				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Callouts toolbar from which you can insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\callouts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	bs	Some shapes have a special handle which you can drag to change properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
