helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3143284	3			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_AS_TEXT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts data selected from the data source browser into the document as text.\</ahelp\>If you select the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> option in the \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog, the content of the data selected in the data source browser is inserted into the document as text. In the dialog, you can decide which database fields or columns are transferred, and how the text is formatted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154289				0	bs	If several records are selected when you choose the \<emph\>Data to Text\</emph\> function, the mail merge fields will be inserted according to the number of records.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155392				0	bs	Text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> area, use the arrow button to select the database table columns into which you want to insert field contents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Events				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148643				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>controls; events\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>events; controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>macros; controls\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148643				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170103.xhp\" name=\"Events\"\>Events\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152350	2			0	bs	On the\<emph\> Events \</emph\>tab page you can link macros to events that occur in a form's control fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	bs	When the event occurs, the linked macro will be called. To assign a macro to an event, press the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button. An \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Assign Macro\"\>Assign Macro\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>dialog\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	bs	Depending on the control, different events are available. Only the available events for the selected control and context are listed on the \<emph\>Events\</emph\> tab page. The following events are defined:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149191				0	bs	Before commencing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>This event takes place before an action is triggered by clicking the control.\</ahelp\> For example,clicking a "Submit" button initiates a send action; however, the actual "send" process is started only when the \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> event occurs. The \<emph\>Before commencing\</emph\> event allows you to kill the process. If the linked method sends back FALSE, \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> will not be executed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	bs	When initiating				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ACTIONPERFORMED\"\>The\<emph\> When initiating \</emph\>event occurs when an action is started.\</ahelp\> For example, if you have a "Submit" button in your form, the send process represents the action to be initiated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156343				0	bs	Changed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148755	42			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Changed \</emph\>event takes place when the control loses the focus and the content of the control has changed since it lost the focus.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153524				0	bs	Text modified				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495	11			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_TEXTCHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Text modified \</emph\>event takes place if you enter or modify a text in an input field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123				0	bs	Item status changed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870	9			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ITEMSTATECHANGED\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Item status changed \</emph\>event takes place if the status of the control field has changed.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Item status changed\</emph\> event takes place if he status of the control field has changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	bs	When receiving focus				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	17			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSGAINED\"\>The\<emph\> When receiving focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field receives the focus.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150447				0	bs	When losing focus				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252	19			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSLOST\"\>The\<emph\> When losing focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field looses the focus.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147287				0	bs	Key pressed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940	21			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYTYPED\"\>The \<emph\>Key pressed \</emph\>event occurs when the user presses any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\> This event may be linked to a macro for checking entries.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154127				0	bs	Key released				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154150	44			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYUP\"\>The\<emph\> Key release \</emph\>event occurs when the user releases any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154921				0	bs	Mouse inside				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618	27			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEENTERED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse inside \</emph\>event takes place if the mouse is inside the control field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576				0	bs	Mouse moved while key pressed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	31			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEDRAGGED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved while key pressed \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is dragged while a key is pressed at the same time.\</ahelp\> An example is when, during drag-and-drop, an additional key determines the mode (move or copy).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149262				0	bs	Mouse moved				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	33			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEMOVED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse moves over the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159197				0	bs	Mouse button pressed				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271	23			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEPRESSED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button pressed \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is pressed while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BD				0	bs	Note that this event is also used for notifying requests for a popup context menu on the control. If you are using this event by a program macro, you find more information in the "StarOffice 8 Programming Guide for BASIC".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148880				0	bs	Mouse button released				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150659	25			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSERELEASED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button released \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is released while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156286				0	bs	Mouse outside				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582	29			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEEXITED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse outside \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is outside the control field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
