helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805				0	bs	You cannot activate the controls of the form or edit contents of database records in Design Mode. However, you can change the position and size of the controls, edit other properties, and add or delete controls in Design Mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
