helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN10567				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The icon opens the Fontwork Gallery from which you can insert graphical text art into your document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
