helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	bs	\<variable id=\"kontroll\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ControlProperties\"\>Opens a dialog for editing the properties of a selected control.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157910	17			0	bs	\<variable id=\"hinweis\"\>You can only call the\<emph\> Properties\</emph\> dialog when in the Design mode with a control selected. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	bs	If you enter data in the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog, note that multiline input is possible for certain drop-down combo boxes. This concerns all fields in which an SQL statement can be entered, as well as the properties of text boxes or label fields. You can open these fields and enter text in the opened list. The following shortcut keys are valid:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148686				0	bs	Keys				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	bs	Effects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150944				0	bs	Opens the combo box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153063				0	bs	Closes the combo box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	bs	Shift+Enter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811				0	bs	Inserts a new line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	bs	Up Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	bs	Places the cursor into the previous line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	bs	Down Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	bs	Places the cursor into the next line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	bs	Enter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	bs	Completes the input in the field and places the cursor into the next field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	bs	As with list boxes or combo boxes, you can open or close the list with a mouse click at the arrow on the right end of the field. However, the input here can be entered either in the opened list or in the top text field. An exception is the properties that expect a list representation, for example, the property \<emph\>List Entries\</emph\>, which can be set for the control fields \<emph\>List Box\</emph\> and \<emph\>Combo Box\</emph\>. Here, you can only edit the entries when the field is opened.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
