helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152372				0	bs	Changes to the contents of a record are automatically saved as soon as you select another record. To save changes without selecting another record, click the \<emph\>Save Record\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
