helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	bs	\<variable id=\"formfiltertext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormFilter\"\>Prompts the database server to filter the visible data by specified criteria.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152918				0	bs	Unlike the normal search, which is activated by the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12100200.xhp\" name=\"Find Record\"\>Find Record\</link\> icon on the \<emph\>Form\</emph\> Bar, you can search more quickly by using the form-based filter. Usually a quick database server is charged with the search. Also, you can enter more complex search conditions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3147226\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formfilter.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147226\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149751				0	bs	Form-based Filters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\colortoolbar.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Color				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\colortoolbar.xhp	0	help	hd_id8983733				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/colortoolbar.xhp\"\>Color\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\colortoolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id1676381				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>With the Color toolbar you can edit some properties of the selected object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\colortoolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id5855281				0	bs	To open the Color toolbar, click the Color icon on the Picture toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	HTML Source				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154788				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>HTML source text\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154788				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/19090000.xhp\" name=\"HTML Source\"\>HTML Source\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SourceView\"\>Displays the source text of the current HTML document. To view the HTML source of a new document, you must first save the new document as an HTML document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	bs	In HTML Source mode, you can view and edit the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#tags\" name=\"tags\"\>tags\</link\> of \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\>. Save the document as a plain text document. Assign an .html or .htm extension to designate the document as HTML.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151299				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/18010000.xhp\" name=\"Selection\"\>Selection\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SelectObject\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Allows you to select objects in the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511				0	bs	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawselect.png\" id=\"img_id3159194\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159194\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	bs	Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	bs	To select an object, click the object with the arrow. To select more than one object, drag a selection frame around the objects. To add an object to a selection, press Shift, and then click the object. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\> \<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"CALC\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"CHART\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"MATH\"/\> \<defaultinline\>The objects selected together can then be defined as a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290000.xhp\" name=\"group\"\>group\</link\>, turning them into a single group object.\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	bs	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\> \<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"CALC\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"CHART\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"MATH\"/\> \<defaultinline\>You can edit individual elements of a group. You can also delete elements from a group with \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Shift\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>+click.\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	bs	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\> \<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"CALC\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"CHART\"/\> \<caseinline select=\"MATH\"/\> \<defaultinline\>You can select single objects from a group by double-click, if you first disable the icon \<emph\>Double-click to edit Text\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Option\</emph\> Bar.\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
