helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:LineEndStyle\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Arrowheads\</emph\> toolbar. Use the symbols shown to define the style for the end of the selected line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150808				0	bs	The \<emph\>Arrow Style\</emph\> icon is only displayed when you create a drawing with the drawing functions. For more information, see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05200300.xhp\" name=\"Line Styles\"\>\<emph\>Line Styles\</emph\>\</link\> section of the Help.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3145090\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_lineendstyle.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145090\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
