helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148983				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>comparison operators; default filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>operators; default filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>default filters; comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>filters; comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148983				0	bs	Comparison Operators				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	bs	The following comparative operators can be set under \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Default Filter\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313	3			0	bs	\<emph\>Comparative operator\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089	4			0	bs	\<emph\>Effect\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	bs	Equal (=)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	bs	Shows values equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	bs	Less than (<)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	bs	Shows values less than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807				0	bs	Greater than (>)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	bs	Shows values greater than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	bs	Less than or equal to (< =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381				0	bs	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	bs	Greater than or equal to (> =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	bs	Shows values that are greater than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811				0	bs	Not equal (< >)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	bs	Shows the values not equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	bs	Largest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	bs	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) largest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	bs	Smallest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	bs	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) smallest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	bs	Largest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161645				0	bs	Shows the largest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the total values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149202				0	bs	Smallest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176				0	bs	Shows the smallest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the entire values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
