helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504	5			0	bs	\<variable id=\"dialogsortieren\"\>To sort more than one data field, choose \<emph\>Data - Sort\</emph\>, then choose the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12100100.xhp\" name=\"Sort Criteria\"\>Sort Criteria\</link\> tab, where you can combine several sort criteria.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
