helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OrderCrit\"\>Specifies the sort order (either ascending or descending).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
