helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3160455	163			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ROWHEIGHT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the row height of a table control field.\</ahelp\>In table controls, enter a value for the row height. If you want, you can enter a value followed by valid measurement unit, for example, 2 cm.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FB6				0	bs	Text lines end with				2002-02-02 02:02:02
