helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	bs	No, I only want to save the value in the form				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_NO\"\>Specifies that the value of this combination field will not be written in the database and will only be saved in the form.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
