helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E3				0	bs	Older File Formats Prior to %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E9				0	bs	If you want to exchange documents with users that still use older versions of %PRODUCTNAME, save the document in the following formats:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398				0	bs	XML file structure				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3149649				0	bs	Documents in OpenDocument file format are stored as compressed zip archives that contain XML files. To view these XML files, you can open the OpenDocument file with an unzip program. The following files and directories are contained within the OpenDocument files:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	bs	The text content of the document is located in \<emph\>content.xml\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3145152				0	bs	The file \<emph\>meta.xml\</emph\> contains the meta information of the document, which you can enter under \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740	33			0	bs	If you save a document with a password, \<emph\>meta.xml\</emph\> will not be encrypted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	bs	The file \<emph\>settings.xml\</emph\> contains further information about the settings for this document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447	35			0	bs	In \<emph\>styles.xml,\</emph\> you find the styles applied to the document that can be seen in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153353	36			0	bs	The \<emph\>meta-inf/manifest.xml\</emph\> file describes the structure of the XML file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153368				0	bs	Additional files and folders can be contained in the packed file format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154299				0	bs	Definition of the XML formats				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AAD				0	bs	The schema for the OpenDocument formats can be found on the \<link href=\"http://www.oasis-open.org\"\>www.oasis-open.org\</link\> web site.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	bs	Note that the formats are subject to certain licenses. You can find notes on the licenses at the start of the DTD files. More detailed information can be found on the \<link href=\"http://www.openoffice.org\" name=\"OpenOffice.org\"\>OpenOffice.org\</link\> website.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
