helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000210.xhp	0	help	par_id3152352	2			0	bs	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SD:MODALDIALOG:DLG_PRINT_WARNINGS\"\>The\<emph\> Warning Print Options \</emph\>dialog appears when the page setup does not match the defined print range.\</ahelp\> This is the case, for example, if you draw a rectangle that is larger than the current page format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150620				0	bs	Print options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
