helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AAE				0	bs	A list of the script functions will appear in the \<emph\>Assigned Macros\</emph\> list box. Select any function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AB6				0	bs	Select to save in %PRODUCTNAME or current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AB9				0	bs	This sets the scope of the new event assignment to be applicable in all of %PRODUCTNAME or only in documents of the current module.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
