helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>. Select a Microsoft Office file in the $[officename] file open dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
