helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3149580				0	bs	$[officename] Calc				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3147574				0	bs	MS PowerPoint, *.ppt, *.pps				2002-02-02 02:02:02
