helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3156276				0	bs	-minimized				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146080				0	bs	Starts minimized. The splash screen is not displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
