helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	bs	Some toolbar icons, for example the \<emph\>Font Color\</emph\> icon, can open another toolbar. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a toolbar containing further icons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3155450	8			0	bs	You now have a choice: either click the icon that you want to activate, or seize the toolbar by its title bar and drag it while holding down the mouse button. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
