helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F7				0	bs	Drag the title bar of the toolbar to an edge of the document window. Alternatively, double-click the title bar or an gray empty place without icons on the toolbar, while holding down the Ctrl key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AC				0	bs	Docking toolbars and windows by drag-and-drop depends on your system's window manager settings. You must enable your system to show the full window contents when you move a window, instead of showing just the outer frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
