helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Format - Axis\</emph\>, then select the axis (or axes) that you would like to edit. A dialog appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	bs	Select from the available sections and make the required changes (for example, select the \<emph\>Scale\</emph\> tab if you want to modify the scale of the axis).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
