helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147289				0	bs	Open the context menu and choose \<emph\>Insert - Background - Page\</emph\> or \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
