helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	bs	In the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> dialog, select a Fontwork style and click OK.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN10755				0	bs	The Fontwork object is inserted into your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	bs	Double-click the object to enter text edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
