helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id7797242				0	bs	The macro recording functionality is only available for text documents in %PRODUCTNAME Writer and for spreadsheets in %PRODUCTNAME Calc.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
