helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	bs	If you drag a graphic from the Gallery into a text, spreadsheet or presentation document, the graphic will be inserted there.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	bs	If you release the graphic \<emph\>directly on a draw object\</emph\>, please note the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825				0	bs	If you move the graphic (drag it without pressing any key, in which case no additional symbol appears next to the mouse pointer), only the attributes are copied from the graphic and applied to the draw object on which you release the mouse button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
