helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3156136				0	bs	You can add texture to the bars in a graph or chart (instead of the default colors) via bitmap graphics:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	bs	Enter edit mode by double-clicking on the chart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275				0	bs	In the context menu choose \<emph\>Object Properties\</emph\>. Then choose the \<emph\>Area\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	bs	Click on \<emph\>Bitmap\</emph\>. In the list box select a bitmap as a texture for the currently selected bars. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to accept the setting.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
