helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829				0	bs	The context menu of the table container offers various functions that apply to all database tables. To edit a special table within the database, select the corresponding table and open its context menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146958				0	bs	Depending on the context, it is possible that not all the functions for your current database are listed in the context menus. For example, the \<emph\>Relationships\</emph\> command for defining relationships between various tables is only available with relational databases.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
