helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02text.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BC				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DSADMIN_DECIMAL_SEPARATOR\"\>Enter or select the character that is used as a decimal separator in the text file, for example, a period (0.5) or a comma (0,5).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
