helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	bs	Copies the selected row(s) to the clipboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156327				0	bs	Paste				2002-02-02 02:02:02
