helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TAB_ENT_DEFAULT\"\>Specifies the value that is the default in new data records.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
