helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131	34			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TAB_ENT_FORMAT_SAMPLE\"\>Displays the format code that you can select with the\<emph\> ... \</emph\>button.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154146				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TAB_ENT_FORMAT\"\>This button opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05340405.xhp\" name=\"Field Format\"\>\<emph\>Field Format\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
