helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395				0	bs	... the field name contains a value that lies between the two values x and y.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154561				0	bs	NOT BETWEEN x AND y				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148753				0	bs	NOT BETWEEN x AND y				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155498				0	bs	Does not fall within the interval [x,y]				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148992				0	bs	... the field name contains a value that does not lie between the two values x and y.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149995				0	bs	IN (a; b; c...)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159167				0	bs	Note that the semicolons are used as separators in all value lists				2002-02-02 02:02:02
