helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154809				0	bs	contains a, b, c...				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148399				0	bs	... the field name contains one of the specified expressions a, b, c,... Any number of expressions can be specified, and the result of the query is determined by an Or link. The expressions a, b, c... can be either numbers or characters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154112				0	bs	NOT IN (a; b; c...)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
