helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158439				0	bs	... the field name does not contain one of the specified expressions a, b, c,...				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145145				0	bs	= TRUE				2002-02-02 02:02:02
