helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_NUMERICFIELD_TAB_PAG_ADABAS_SETTINGS_NF_CACHE_SIZE\"\>Enter the size of the data buffer for the database.\</ahelp\> The setting takes effect after you restart the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149095				0	bs	Increment size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_NUMERICFIELD_TAB_PAG_ADABAS_SETTINGS_NF_DATA_INCREMENT\"\>Enter the size by which you want to automatically increment the database. The maximum increment size is 100 MB.\</ahelp\> The setting takes effect after you restart the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156346				0	bs	Control User Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150355				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_EDIT_TAB_PAG_ADABAS_SETTINGS_ET_CTRLUSERNAME\"\>Enter the name of a user that you want to give limited control to modify some parameters of the database.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
