helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	bs	For example, for a "Bibliography" data source, you can enter the following SQL command:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	bs	SELECT "Address" FROM "biblio" "biblio"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145611				0	bs	For more information on SQL commands, please consult the documentation that came with the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
