helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144433				0	bs	Database settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	bs	Drives containing parts of the Serverdb are called DEVSPACEs. To improve performance, store each DEVSPACE on separate drives.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985				0	bs	The file path for a DEVSPACE, including its file name, cannot exceed 40 characters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
