helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143	2			0	bs	In the data source explorer, you can copy a table by dragging and dropping the table onto the table container. The \<emph\>Apply columns \</emph\>dialog is the second window of the \<emph\>Copy table\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
