helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02ldap.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CE				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DSADMIN_USESSL_LDAP\"\>Creates a secure connection to the LDAP server through the Secure Sockets Layer (SSL).\</ahelp\> By default, an SSL connection uses port 636. A regular connection uses port 389.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
