helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Convert to 3D 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154017				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13050300.xhp\" name=\"Convert to 3D\"\>Convert to 3D\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertInto3D\"\>Converts the selected object to a three-dimensional (3D) object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147339				0	bs	\<variable id=\"anmerkung\"\>The selected object is first converted to a contour, and then to a 3D object.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149127	3			0	bs	If you select two or more objects and convert them to 3D, the result is a 3D group that acts as a single object. You can edit the individual objects in the group by choosing \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Modify\</emph\> - \<emph\>Enter Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Format - Group - Edit Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>. Choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Modify – Exit Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Format – Group – Exit Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you are finished.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242				0	bs	Converting a group of objects to 3D does not change the stacking order of the individual objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146965				0	bs	Press F3 to quickly enter a group and Ctrl+F3 to leave the group.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145114				0	bs	You can also convert bitmap images and vector graphics, including clipart, to 3D objects. $[officename] treats bitmaps as rectangles and vector graphics as a group of polygons when converting to 3D.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149876				0	bs	Even drawing objects that contain text can be converted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153960				0	bs	If you want, you can also apply a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05350000.xhp\" name=\"3D Effect\"\>3D Effect\</link\> to the converted object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
