helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684	2			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SD_BTN_HANDOUT\"\>Switches to handout page, where you can scale several slides to fit on one printed page.\</ahelp\> To modify the number of slides you can print on a page, choose \<emph\>Format - Modify Layout\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
