helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511	19			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Cyramid\"\>Draws a pyramid with a square base where you drag in the slide. To draw a pyramid with a rectangular base, hold down Shift while you drag. To define a different polygon for the base of the pyramid, open the \<emph\>3D Effects \</emph\>dialog and click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05350200.xhp\" name=\"Geometry\"\>\<emph\>Geometry\</emph\>\</link\> tab. In the \<emph\>Segments\</emph\> area, enter the number of sides for the polygon in the box labeled \<emph\>Horizontal\</emph\>, and then click the green checkmark.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
