helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	bs	The title of a hidden slide has a gray background. To show a hidden slide, choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Show/Hide Slide\</emph\> again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
