helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\html_import.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610				0	bs	Locate the file containing the text that you want to add, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\html_import.xhp	0	help	par_id3153915				0	bs	If the text file contains more text than can be inserted into a single slide, you can divide the text over several slides.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
