helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\html_import.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Insert – Slide\</emph\>, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
