helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147171				0	bs	Navigate to the slide where you want to move the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+V\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
