helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153415				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>vectorizing bitmaps\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting; bitmaps to polygons\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bitmaps; converting to vector graphics\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>vector graphics;converting bitmaps\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153415				0	bs	\<variable id=\"vectorize\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/vectorize.xhp\" name=\"Converting Bitmap Images into Vector Graphics\"\>Converting Bitmap Images into Vector Graphics\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3155633				0	bs	A vector graphic can be resized without losing the quality of the graphic. In $[officename] Draw and Impress, you can convert a bitmap image into a vector graphic.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151241				0	bs	Select the bitmap image that you want to convert.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	bs	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	bs	In $[officename] Draw, choose \<emph\>Modify - Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	bs	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3149349				0	bs	Set the conversion options for the image, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. See \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13050200.xhp\" name=\"Convert to Polygon\"\>\<emph\>Convert to Polygon\</emph\>\</link\> for a description of the conversion options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
