helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150439				0	bs	\<variable id=\"orgchart\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/orgchart.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Flowchart\"\>Creating a Flowchart\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	bs	To create a flowchart:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	bs	Select a tool from the \<emph\>Flowchart\</emph\> toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	bs	Drag a shape in your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	bs	To add more shapes, repeat the last steps.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146967	43			0	bs	Open the \<emph\>Connectors \</emph\>toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and select a connector line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3149945				0	bs	Move the pointer over the edge of a shape so that the connection sites appear.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146871				0	bs	Click a connection site, drag to a connection site on another shape, and then release.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145824				0	bs	To add more connectors, repeat the last steps.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3153036				0	bs	You now have the basic outline for your flowchart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155255				0	bs	To add text to the shapes on your flowchart				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150865				0	bs	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145592				0	bs	Double-click the shape, and type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154504				0	bs	Click the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and drag a text object over the shape. Type or paste your text into the text object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153730				0	bs	To add a color fill to a shape:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3155930				0	bs	Select the shape, and choose \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145348				0	bs	Select \<emph\>Color\</emph\>, and then click a color in the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150934				0	bs	To add some hot spots that call other slides:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145300	57			0	bs	Assign \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06070000.xhp\" name=\"interactions\"\>interactions\</link\> to some objects on your slide. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_idN10898				0	bs	Select the object, then choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Interaction\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
