helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242				0	bs	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3143233				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>View - Slide Sorter\</emph\>, select one or more slides, and then drag the slides to another location. To select multiple slides, hold down shift and click on the slides. To create a copy of a selected slide, hold down Ctrl while you drag. The mouse pointer changes to a plus sign. You can also drag a copy of a slide into another open $[officename] Impress document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	par_id3153072				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>View - Outline\</emph\>, select a slide, and then drag the slide to another location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
