helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\align_arrange.xhp	0	help	par_id3153727				0	bs	Each object that you place in your document is successively stacked on the preceding object. To re-arrange the stacking order of a selected object proceed as follows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
