helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\align_arrange.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E6				0	bs	\<emph\>Bring to Front\</emph\> places the object on top of all other objects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\align_arrange.xhp	0	help	par_idN107EC				0	bs	\<emph\>Bring Forward\</emph\> places the object one place forward in the stack of objects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\align_arrange.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F2				0	bs	\<emph\>Send Backward\</emph\> places the object one place back in the stack of objects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\align_arrange.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F8				0	bs	\<emph\>Send to Back\</emph\> places the object behind all other objects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
