helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\align_arrange.xhp	0	help	par_id3150535				0	bs	Selected objects are distributed evenly along the horizontal or vertical axis. The two outermost objects are used as reference points and do not move when the \<emph\>Distribution\</emph\> command is applied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
