helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163137				0	bs	\<emph\>Data_Y\</emph\> represents the Y Data array.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163155				0	bs	\<emph\>Data_X\</emph\> (optional) represents the X Data array.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163174				0	bs	\<emph\>Function_Type\</emph\> (optional). If Function_Type = 0, functions in the form y = m^x will be calculated. Otherwise, y = b*m^x functions will be calculated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163196				0	bs	\<emph\>Stats\</emph\> (optional). If Stats=0, only the regression coefficient is calculated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
