helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	par_id3151346				0	bs	Use an integer to set the \<emph\>minute\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	par_id3151366				0	bs	Use an integer to set the \<emph\>second\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
