helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	bs	Sort by				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055B				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387653\"\>Select the data field that you want to sort columns or rows by.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	bs	Ascending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384580\"\>Sorts the values from the lowest value to the highest value, that is, from A to Z or from 1 to 9. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10565				0	bs	Descending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10569				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384581\"\>Sorts the values descending from the highest value to the lowest value, that is from Z to A or from 9 to 1. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	bs	Manual				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10570				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384582\"\>Sorts values alphabetically, that is , from A to Z.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10585				0	bs	Display options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	bs	You can specify the display options for all row fields except for the last, innermost row field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
