helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	bs	This function works per level. For instance, if one level of traces has already been activated to show the precedents (or dependents), then you would see the next dependency level by activating the \<emph\>Trace\</emph\> function again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
