helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3151309				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_FACTDOUBLE\"\>The result is the factorial of the number with increments of 2.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154666				0	bs	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3155121				0	bs	FACTDOUBLE(Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3158440	40			0	bs	Number: if the number is even, the following factorial is calculated: n*(N-2)*(n-4)*...*4*2.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154622				0	bs	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116	43			0	bs	=FACTDOUBLE(6) returns 48.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
