helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	bs	DAYSINYEAR(Date)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153803				0	bs	Date: The date up through which a number of days in the year is calculated. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153487				0	bs	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	bs	DAYSINYEAR(A1) returns 366 days if A1 contains 2/29/68, a valid date for the year 1968.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154737				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>DAYSINMONTH function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154737				0	bs	DAYSINMONTH				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3149316				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DAYSINMONTH\"\>Calculates the number of days in a month until a given date.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145114				0	bs	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3150955				0	bs	DAYSINMONTH(Date)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3147501				0	bs	Date: The date up through which the days in the month is calculated. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149871				0	bs	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3155742				0	bs	DAYSINMONTH(A1) returns 29 days if A1 contains 2/17/68, a valid date for February 1968.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149048				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>WEEKS function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149048				0	bs	WEEKS				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153340				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DIFFWEEKS\"\>Calculates the difference in weeks between two dates.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
