helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3149351				0	bs	Add-ins can also be implemented through the %PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"http://api.openoffice.org/\"\>API\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
