helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151211				0	bs	This command activates the Spreadsheet Detective. With the Detective, you can trace the dependencies from the current formula cell to the cells in the spreadsheet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
