helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144687				0	bs	=QUOTIENT(11;3) returns 3. The remainder of 2 is omitted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3144702				0	bs	\<bookmark_value\>RADIANS function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
