helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145173	2			0	bs	\<variable id=\"datenbanktext\"\>This section deals with functions used with data organized as one row of data for one record. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154016				0	bs	The \<emph\>Database\</emph\> category may be confused with a database integrated in $[officename]. However, there is no connection between a database in $[officename] and the \<emph\>Database\</emph\> category in $[officename] Calc.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
