helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150482				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SAEUBERN\"\>All non-printing characters are removed from the string.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
