helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3162905				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GROSS\"\>Converts the string specified in the \<emph\>text\</emph\> field to uppercase.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
