helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_year.xhp	0	help	par_id3147496				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_JAHR\"\>Returns the year as a number according to the internal calculation rules.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
