helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153092				0	bs	All values				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	bs	No limitation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
