helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10724				0	bs	Sort entries ascending				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10728				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:CheckBox:TP_VALIDATION_VALUES:CB_SORTLIST\"\>Sorts the selection list in ascending order and filters duplicates from the list. If not checked, the order from the data source is taken.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
