helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153199	14			0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:TP_VALIDATION_VALUES:EDT_MIN\"\>Enter the minimum value for the data validation option that you selected in the \<emph\>Allow \</emph\>box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
