helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D1				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"26275\"\>Inserts a sheet from a different spreadsheet file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F7				0	bs	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\"\>file open\</link\> dialog to locate the spreadsheet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10609				0	bs	In the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04050000.xhp\"\>Insert Sheet\</link\> dialog, select the sheet that you want to insert.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
