helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140100.xhp\" name=\"Down\"\>Down\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillDown\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the top cell of the range.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	bs	If a selected range has only one column, the contents of the top cell are copied to all others. If several columns are selected, the contents of the corresponding top cell will be copied down.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04010100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	Row Break				2002-02-02 02:02:02
