helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_COLROWNAMERANGES:BTN_ROWHEAD\"\>Includes row labels in the current label range.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
