helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	bs	In this section you can select or deselect the available formatting options. If you want to keep any of the settings currently in your spreadsheet, deselect the corresponding option.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
