helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153878				0	bs	Copy sort results to:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCPAGE_SORT_OPTIONS:BTN_COPYRESULT\"\>Copies the sorted list to the cell range that you specify.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
