helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	bs	Number: the decimal number. If \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is negative, the function returns a binary number with 10 characters. The most significant bit is the sign bit, the other 9 bits return the value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
