helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154375				0	bs	In the above formats, the number of decimal places after the decimal separator is given as a number. Example: the number format #,##0.0 returns ,1 and the number format 00.000% returns P3				2002-02-02 02:02:02
