helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3146829	167			0	bs	TIMEVALUE("4PM") returns 0.67. When formatting in time format HH:MM:SS, you then get 16:00:00.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632	168			0	bs	TIMEVALUE("24:00") returns 1. If you use the HH:MM:SS time format, the value is 00:00:00.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
