helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_AMORDEGRC\"\>Calculates the amount of depreciation for a settlement period as degressive amortization.\</ahelp\> Unlike AMORLINC, a depreciation coefficient that is independent of the depreciable life is used here.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
