helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147436				0	bs	\<variable id=\"cellreferences\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellreferences.xhp\" name=\"Referencing a Cell in Another Document\"\>Referencing a Cell in Another Document\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
