helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	bs	Select the cells whose text you want to rotate.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155133				0	bs	Choose \<emph\>Format - Cells\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
