helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146931				0	bs	Superscript top				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3159195				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_CSUPX\"\>Inserts a superscript directly above a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?>csup<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN100FF				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3149097\" src=\"starmath/res/co21908.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149097\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
