helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_RSUPX\"\>Inserts a superscript to the right of a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?>^{<?>}\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window, or you can use \<emph\>rsup\</emph\> or \<emph\>sup\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN1013E				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3149044\" src=\"starmath/res/co21905.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149044\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
