helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154592				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ALIGNLX\"\>This icon assigns left-alignment to "a" and inserts a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can type \<emph\>alignl<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN10317				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3156130\" src=\"starmath/res/co21910.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156130\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
