helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090906.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154704				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03090906.xhp\" name=\"Matrix in Bold Font\"\>Matrix in Bold Font\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090906.xhp	0	help	par_id3150342				0	bs	Here is an example of how to create a bold font matrix in \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\>. You can copy this example to the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window using the clipboard and use it in your own formula.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
