helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153627				0	bs	Limits				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149755				0	bs	Defines the spacing between the sum symbol and the limit conditions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
