helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154690				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_UPPERLIMIT_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between the sum symbol and the upper limit.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
