helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154140				0	bs	Minimum spacing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_INTERATTRIBUT_DIST\"\>Determines the minimum distance between a symbol and variable.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149302				0	bs	Operators				2002-02-02 02:02:02
