helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_idN104E0				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3154038\" src=\"starmath/res/op21419.png\" width=\"8.47mm\" height=\"8.47mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154038\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
