helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149974				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_SETQ\"\>Use this icon to insert a character for the \<emph\>set of rational numbers\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> You can also do this by directly entering \<emph\>setq\</emph\> in the Commands window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_idN10519				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3149625\" src=\"starmath/res/op21420.png\" width=\"8.47mm\" height=\"8.47mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149625\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
