helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10322				0	bs	\<image id=\"img_id3154578\" src=\"starmath/res/fo21611.png\" width=\"6.35mm\" height=\"6.35mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154578\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
