helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147338				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03050000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom Out\"\>Zoom Out\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149500				0	bs	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_TOOLBOX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>This is a list of operators, functions, symbols and format options that can be inserted into the formula.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	bs	Some \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03090900.xhp\" name=\"examples\"\>examples\</link\> show you the range of operations. You can find more examples in the \<emph\>Samples - Formulas\</emph\> folder.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	bs	The selection window is divided into two parts. Clicking a symbol at the top of the window displays its subordinate symbols in the lower half of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153250				0	bs	You can access the same functions in submenus through the context menu of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
