helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	bs	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> A numeric expression that contains a serial date number from which you can determine the day of the month.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	bs	This function is basically the opposite of the DateSerial function, returning the day of the month from a serial date number generated by the \<emph\>DateSerial\</emph\> or the \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\> function. For example, the expression				2002-02-02 02:02:02
