helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154306				0	bs	Pathname				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	bs	Complete path and program name of the program that you want to start.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150771				0	bs	Windowstyle				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	bs	Optional integer expression that specifies the style of the window that the program is executed in. The following values are possible:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	bs	0				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	bs	The focus is on the hidden program window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	bs	1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3144760				0	bs	The focus is on the program window in standard size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	bs	2				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	bs	The focus is on the minimized program window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	bs	3				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146921				0	bs	focus is on the maximized program window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	bs	4				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	bs	Standard size program window, without focus.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	bs	6				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152938				0	bs	Minimized program window, focus remains on the active window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	bs	10				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	bs	Full-screen display.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150419				0	bs	Param				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149412				0	bs	Any string expression that specifies the command line that want to pass.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148456				0	bs	bSync				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096				0	bs	If this value is set to \<emph\>true\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Shell\</emph\> command and all $[officename] tasks wait until the shell process completes. If the value is set to \<emph\>false\</emph\>, the shell returns directly. The default value is \<emph\>false\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
