helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3163807				0	bs	If you want to insert the library as a reference only check the \<emph\>Insert as reference (read-only)\</emph\> box. Read-only libraries are fully functional but cannot be modified in the Basic IDE.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
