helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	bs	\<emph\>n:\</emph\> Numeric expression that specifies the number of characters that you want to return. If \<emph\>n\</emph\> = 0, a zero-length string is returned. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
