helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798	6			0	bs	\<emph\>Text\</emph\>: String expression displayed as a message in the dialog box. Line breaks can be inserted with Chr$(13).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769	7			0	bs	\<emph\>DialogTitle\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the title bar of the dialog. If omitted, the title bar displays the name of the respective application.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228	8			0	bs	\<emph\>Type\</emph\>: Any integer expression that specifies the dialog type, as well as the number and type of buttons to display, and the icon type. \<emph\>Type\</emph\> represents a combination of bit patterns, that is, a combination of elements can be defined by adding their respective values:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
