helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153380				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020405.xhp\" name=\"FileAttr-Function [Runtime]\"\>FileAttr Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	bs	Returns the access mode or the file access number of a file that was opened with the Open statement. The file access number is dependent on the operating system (OSH = Operating System Handle).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3153364				0	bs	If you use a 32-Bit operating system, you cannot use the FileAttr-Function to determine the file access number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
