helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154760				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/keys.xhp\" name=\"Keyboard Shortcuts in the Basic IDE\"\>Keyboard Shortcuts in the Basic IDE\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3149655				0	bs	In the Basic IDE you can use the following keyboard shortcuts:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
