helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3159254				0	bs	Run code starting from the first line, or from the current breakpoint, if the program stopped there before				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3163712				0	bs	F5				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	bs	Stop				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	bs	Shift+F5				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	bs	Add \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01050100.xhp\" name=\"watch\"\>watch\</link\> for the variable at the cursor				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	bs	F7				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	bs	Single step through each statement, starting at the first line or at that statement where the program execution stopped before.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3150716				0	bs	F8				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3156275				0	bs	Single step as with F8, but a function call is considered to be only \<emph\>one\</emph\> statement				2002-02-02 02:02:02
