helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153127				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030108.xhp\" name=\"CDateFromIso Function [Runtime]\"\>CDateFromIso Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	bs	Returns the internal date number from a string that contains a date in ISO format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
