helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03100400.xhp\" name=\"CDbl Function [Runtime]\"\>CDbl Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
