helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	bs	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any string or numeric expression that you want to convert. To convert a string expression, the number must be entered as normal text ("123.5") using the default number format of your operating system.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
