helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	bs	Exit Sub				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	bs	\<emph\>Label1:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3152462				0	bs	statement block				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	bs	GoTo Label2				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886				0	bs	End Sub/Function				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	bs	Use the GoTo statement to instruct $[officename] Basic to continue program execution at another place within the procedure. The position must be indicated by a label. To set a label, assign a name, and then and end it with a colon (":").				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	par_id3155416				0	bs	You cannot use the GoTo statement to jump out of a Sub or Function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090302.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154731				0	bs	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bs	RGB Function [Runtime]				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03010305.xhp\" name=\"RGB Function [Runtime]\"\>RGB Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	bs	Returns a \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000003.xhp#farbcodes\" name=\"long integer color value\"\>long integer color value\</link\> consisting of red, green, and blue components.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147229				0	bs	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	bs	RGB (Red, Green, Blue)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
