helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	bs	Long				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154013				0	bs	Parameter:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597	8			0	bs	\<emph\>Red\</emph\>: Any integer expression that represents the red component (0-255) of the composite color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974	9			0	bs	\<emph\>Green\</emph\>: Any integer expression that represents the green component (0-255) of the composite color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
