helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030206.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149670				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030206.xhp\" name=\"TimeValue Function [Runtime]\"\>TimeValue Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030206.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	bs	Calculates a serial time value from the specified hour, minute, and second - parameters passed as strings - that represents the time in a single numeric value. This value can be used to calculate the difference between times.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030206.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154138				0	bs	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
