helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	bs	\<emph\>ExpressionTrue, ExpressionFalse:\</emph\> Any expression, one of which will be returned as the function result, depending on the logical evaluation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
