helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143268				0	bs	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120306.xhp\" name=\"Mid Function, Mid Statement [Runtime]\"\>Mid Function, Mid Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	bs	Returns the specified portion of a string expression (\<emph\>Mid function\</emph\>), or replaces the portion of a string expression with another string (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154285				0	bs	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	bs	Mid (Text As String, Start As Long [, Length As Long]) or Mid (Text As String, Start As Long , Length As Long, Text As String)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	bs	Return value:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	bs	String (only by Function)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154347				0	bs	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	bs	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359	9			0	bs	\<emph\>Start: \</emph\>Numeric expression that indicates the character position within the string where the string portion that you want to replace or to return begins. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	bs	\<emph\>Length:\</emph\> Numeric expression that returns the number of characters that you want to replace or return. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	bs	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid function\</emph\> is omitted, all characters in the string expression from the start position to the end of the string are returned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	bs	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\> is less than the length of the text that you want to replace, the text is reduced to the specified length.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769				0	bs	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> The string to replace the string expression (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
