helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020415.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769				0	bs	Bool				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020415.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153770				0	bs	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020415.xhp	0	help	par_id3147349				0	bs	FileName | DirectoryName: Any string expression that contains an unambiguous file specification. You can also use \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020415.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149664				0	bs	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
