helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090410.xhp	0	help	par_id3148522				0	bs	Evaluates a list of arguments, consisting of an expression followed by a value. The Switch function returns a value that is associated with the expression that is passed by this function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
