helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436	75			0	bs	\<variable id=\"sytextbeschr\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ToggleAxisDescr\"\>The\<emph\> AxesTitle On/Off \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> bar switches the labeling of all axes on or off.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
