helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149353				0	bs	Problems may arise in displaying labels if the size of your chart is too small. You can avoid this by either enlarging the view or decreasing the font size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
