helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	bs	\<variable id=\"achsen\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DiagramAxisAll\"\>Opens a\<emph/\>dialog, where you can edit the properties of the selected axis.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The name of the dialog depends on the selected axis.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	bs	The \<link href=\"text/schart/01/05040200.xhp\" name=\"Y axis\"\>Y axis\</link\> has an enhanced dialog. For X-Y charts, the X axis chart is also enhanced by the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/05040201.xhp\" name=\"Scaling\"\>\<emph\>Scaling\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159266				0	bs	Scaling the X axis is only possible in the X-Y chart type.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
