helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750				0	bs	Use this to change the properties of a selected data row. This dialog appears when one data row is selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Object Properties\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154015				0	bs	Any changes made here affect the entire data row. For example, if you change the color, all elements belonging to this data row will change color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
