helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	bs	You can enter values for subdividing axes in this area. You can automatically set the five properties \<emph\>Minimum, Maximum, Major interval, Minor interval\</emph\> and \<emph\>Axis at\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
