helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577				0	bs	This dialog allows you to change the properties of a selected data point. The dialog appears when there is only one data point selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Object Properties\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
